<li><a rel="external" href="https://crates.io/crates/assert_cmd">assert_cmd</a>: fixed</li>
<li><a rel="external" href="https://crates.io/crates/cli_test_dir">cli_test_dir</a>: <a rel="external" href="https://github.com/emk/subtitles-rs/issues/65">Issue #65</a></li>
<li><a rel="external" href="https://crates.io/crates/compiletest_rs">compiletest_rs</a>: <a rel="external" href="https://github.com/Manishearth/compiletest-rs/issues/309">Issue #309</a></li>
<li><a rel="external" href="https://crates.io/crates/executable-path">executable-path</a>: fixed</li>
<li><a rel="external" href="https://crates.io/crates/snapbox">snapbox</a>: fixed</li>
<li><a rel="external" href="https://crates.io/crates/term-transcript">term-transcript</a>: <a rel="external" href="https://github.com/slowli/term-transcript/issues/269">Issue #269</a></li>
<li><a rel="external" href="https://crates.io/crates/test_bin">test_bin</a>: <a rel="external" href="https://github.com/MichaelMcDonnell/test_bin/issues/13">Issue #13</a></li>
